# KS-1062 F-1 PIN WHAT THE TENANT LOOP LOGS WHEN A TENANT FAILS (the INCOMPLETE summary, and the FIRST error) — Wednesday's task for Ornith, TEST_ONLY, **ONE NEW vitest test file, no product file** (written 2026-09-19, round 5)

