```
Reds: `summary`

### SUMMARYCOMPLETE — the tenant summary says complete even when a tenant FAILED
File: `Blockchain/Dev/services/api-gateway/src/startup-migrations.ts`
Line: 1210
From:
```
          failedTenants > 0
```
To:
```
