- WITH the new file: FIRSTERRORLAST → exactly 1 red of 616, `firsterr` (`AssertionError: expected [ true, 'qa statement 39 refused' ] to deeply equal [ true, 'qa statement 1 refused' ]`); SUMMARYINFO → exactly 1 red of 616, `summary` (AssertionError, `[ false, … ]`); SUMMARYCOMPLETE → exactly 1 red of 616, `summary` (AssertionError, `[ false, … ]`). `control` green under all three.

